# The root .gitignore excludes `*.stl` — a sensible rule for generated exports,
# and the reason these vendored meshes were silently dropped from their own
# commit. On macOS git sets `core.ignorecase=true`, so `*.stl` matches
# `Trunk.STL`, and `git add third_party/` skipped all 24 files without a word.
# Tests passed locally because the files were present but untracked; the sample
# rendered nothing on any other machine.
#
# These meshes ARE the vendored asset (see README.md), so re-include them.
!*.STL
!*.stl
